[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12125.67, "timestamp": "03:22:05", "text": "事物。嗯，是的，我也会尽力而为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12127.229, "timestamp": "03:22:07", "text": "继续做我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12131.15, "timestamp": "03:22:11", "text": "最好的。是的，我发推文了。我把它放进去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12133.75, "timestamp": "03:22:13", "text": "到处。 Discord。不，我没有做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12135.87, "timestamp": "03:22:15", "text": "本次通话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12139.63, "timestamp": "03:22:19", "text": "是的，即使在所有类似的事物中也是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12142.87, "timestamp": "03:22:22", "text": "外表，我希望你能知道哪个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12145.71, "timestamp": "03:22:25", "text": "就是我，就在我之内"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12148.71, "timestamp": "03:22:28", "text": "他们。希望你不会……你不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12152.12, "timestamp": "03:22:32", "text": "把我认成别人了吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12155.229, "timestamp": "03:22:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12159.349, "timestamp": "03:22:39", "text": "那么，我为什么要发这条推文呢？我为什么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12162.71, "timestamp": "03:22:42", "text": "解决这个问题吗？好的，问吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12165.429, "timestamp": "03:22:45", "text": "我们。这可能不仅仅是因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12167.429, "timestamp": "03:22:47", "text": "就是那个全息风暴装置，但它可以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12170.349, "timestamp": "03:22:50", "text": "任何事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12174.309, "timestamp": "03:22:54", "text": "其他的其实可以是任何东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12177.15, "timestamp": "03:22:57", "text": "什么？重要的是我"}]